    assert.strictEqual(ms('10 mins'), 600000);
    assert.strictEqual(ms('1 mins'), 60000);
  });
});
"}, "note": "The diff removes the 'mins' switch case while the regex still captures 'mins' as a unit, so ms('10 mins') now falls to default and returns undefined instead of 600000. The replacement case "" is unreachable because type comes from (match[2] || 'ms').toLowerCase(), which is never an empty string."}
```

